{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22814","headline":"读李杜诗集因题卷後 · 白居易","name":"读李杜诗集因题卷後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翰林江左日，员外劒南时。\n不得高官职，仍逢苦乱离。\n暮年逋客恨，浮世谪仙悲。\n吟咏留千古，声名动四夷。\n文场供秀句，乐府待新词。\n天意君须会，人间要好诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}